},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Failure","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s25BorrowingIteratorProtocolP7FailureQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Span","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s25BorrowingIteratorProtocolP7ElementQa"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/borrowingiteratorprotocol\/nextspan(maxcount:)","title":"nextSpan(maxCount:)","required":true,"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/BorrowingIteratorProtocol\/nextSpan(maxCount:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a span over the next group of elements that are ready to by visited,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"up to the specifed maximum.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Span":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Span","type":"topic","title":"Span","abstract":[{"code":"Span<Element>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a contiguous region of memory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which contains initialized instances of "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Span"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Span"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/span"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Build apps using a powerful open language.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift","title":"Swift","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Int":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A signed integer value type."}],"ur